OL,5,G1700 This Classical Life
OL,6,     FJess swaps favourite music with
OL,7,     Fthe conductor Dalia Stasevska,
OL,8,     Fincluding music by Walton and
OL,9,     FBach, Dalia's favourite Sibelius
OL,10,     Fsymphony and her organ-based
OL,11,     Fguilty pleasure.
OL,12,G1800 Opera on 3
OL,13,     FThe Figaro of Alex Esposito joins
OL,14,     Fthe Susanna of Louise Alder and
OL,15,     Fthe Countess of Masabane Cecilia
OL,16,     FRangwanasha in a classic staging
OL,17,     Fof Mozart's The Marriage of
OL,18,     FFigaro.
